  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8cfc9115-fa6e-418d-9885-ee3556e45b2c.png\" alt=\"星界世界\" width=\"850\" height=\"438\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_2014cae8-e980-448a-ae26-71aa1dbe2c1c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_60d8a93e-e582-44bd-a3ce-d1fd4060d699.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgalosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_66523eaa-30a9-4917-91fe-6b285214aa0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fOrcinusWasTaken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_d02d553b-ab4f-492f-bc41-d94c2699505d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_45b4c79a-5c20-4617-86a0-451eeb134516.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📘: 总体概览</strong></span></p><p>星界世界是一个旨在通过添加新内容（如新生物群系、机制、生物等）来改善地下世界的模组。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📝: 注意事项</strong></span></p><p>本模组支持 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric。星界世界是一个旨在通过添加新内容（如新生物群系、机制、生物等）来改善地下世界的模组。</p><p>如果你对这个模组有任何建议，可以加入我的 Discord 服务器了解更多。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🧰: 整合包制作</strong></span></p><p>你可以在你的整合包中使用本模组，但请务必注明出处！</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>💎: 一些特性</strong></span></p><p>水晶峡谷</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_eb0b2eef-05a0-4186-ac0c-2e00fad7631d.png\" alt=\"水晶峡谷\" width=\"850\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<p><strong><em>水晶峡谷</em></strong>包含两种新宝石——<strong>铝辉石与光石</strong>，它们在该生物群系中形成了巨大的水晶结构。探索时，你还能发现<strong>闪亮，</strong>它们背上能生长铝辉石和光石！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_c07a97ae-936a-4ce3-8749-f071bc888889.png\" alt=\"水晶峡谷效果图\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div><p>地衣洞穴</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8e32f1c5-d999-44d2-ba60-4ca5729b61df.png\" alt=\"地衣洞穴\" width=\"850\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><strong>地衣洞穴</strong>覆盖着<strong>地衣苔藓</strong>和巨型蘑菇。你可以发现小小的<strong>幽魂</strong>在生物群系中安静地飞舞和观察。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_13a3ba2e-03fe-424e-a308-a0a6b91bf45f.png\" alt=\"地衣洞穴效果图\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div><p>粉盐洞穴</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_2e0906c1-4c79-4b51-9030-1b3a26e153a6.png\" alt=\"粉盐洞穴\" width=\"850\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p><strong>粉盐洞穴</strong>覆盖着粉色、玫瑰色和粉彩色的盐类。探索这片咸咸的生物群系时，你可能会偶然发现神秘的<strong>古老神殿</strong>……</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8bb0f6b5-06bc-4958-b155-58d1fc23199e.png\" alt=\"粉盐洞穴效果图\" width=\"850\" height=\"326\"></p>\n</div><p>遗忘废墟</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_f2275f3a-0c3e-4a59-86e1-831ad7a8a77b.png\" alt=\"遗忘废墟\" width=\"850\" height=\"326\"></p>\n<p><strong>遗忘废墟</strong>是一个稀有的<strong>地下建筑</strong>，里面充满了供你清理的<strong>可疑方块</strong>。你甚至能找到一些<strong>鼹鼠</strong>，它们可能会给你一些<strong>支线任务</strong>，让你在旅途中完成。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_59b1d7d4-8ec5-4262-8aba-98fdf2a1df45.png\" alt=\"遗忘废墟1\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8429e5a0-1ca8-4bc1-ab3b-27384386ccd9.png\" alt=\"遗忘废墟2\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📺: <strong>模组预览</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:614px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vxodY0zYmZE\" width=\"607\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ajl3DW2PjGo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RRmG0DUYOYI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/en8u3KcWUPU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xpVSGRDQLcc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h3>\n</div><p><img></p>",
